項，得 x＝-84；代入原式左右相等。","answerFormat":"single-choice","verification":{"equation":"x/4+5=x/7-4","root":"-84","domain":"rational"},"format":"single-choice","correctOptionId":"c4","options":[{"id":"c1","text":"28/3","misconception":"錯把左側+5改成−5，破壞等式。"},{"id":"c2","text":"-28/3","misconception":"移項時錯把原本−4當成+4。"},{"id":"c3","text":"-3","misconception":"乘公分母28時只乘未知數項，未乘常數。"},{"id":"c4","text":"-84"}],"bankId":"linear-equations","category":"解一元一次方程式"},{"id":"Q021","typeId":"分數係數","difficulty":"中","sourceRefs":["S02:p2","S05:p2","S09:p3","S17:p1"],"prompt":"求使等式 2*x-(4-x)/3=1 成立的 x。","answer":"1","explanation":"合併同類項並移項，得 x＝1；代入原式左右相等。","answerFormat":"single-choice","verification":{"equation":"2*x-(4-x)/3=1","root":"1","domain":"rational"},"format":"single-choice","correctOptionId":"c1","options":[{"id":"c1","text":"1"},{"id":"c2","text":"5/7","misconception":"只把右側1除以3，左側保持不變，破壞等式。"},{"id":"c3","text":"15/7","misconception":"分母3只除到x，沒有除到常數4。"},{"id":"c4","text":"7/5","misconception":"減去括號前負號處理錯誤，將4−x改成4+x。"}],"bankId":"linear-equations","category":"解一元一次方程式"},{"id":"Q022","typeId":"分數係數","difficulty":"中","sourceRefs":["S02:p2","S05:p2","S09:p3","S17:p1"],"prompt":"求使等式 (3*x-1)/4-(x+1)/2=1 成立的 x。","answer":"7","explanation":"合併同類項並移項，得 x＝7；代入原式左右相等。","answerFormat":"single-choice","verification":{"equation":"(3*x-1)/4-(x+1)/2=1","root":"7","domain":"rational"},"format":"single-choice","correctOptionId":"c2","options":[{"id":"c1","text":"4","misconception":"乘公分母4時漏把右側1乘以4。"},{"id":"c2","text":"7"},{"id":"c3","text":"3","misconception":"去除第二分式的負號時，常數1變號錯誤。"},{"id":"c4","text":"-9","misconception":"錯把第二個分式的分母2直接刪除，沒有維持等式。"}],"bankId":"linear-equations","category":"解一元一次方程式"},{"id":"Q025","typeId":"小數係數","difficulty":"中","sourceRefs":["S02:p2","S02:p5","S05:p2","S09:p3"],"prompt":"求使等式 0.5*x-1.5=-0.5*x+2.5 成立的 x。","answer":"4","explanation":"合併同類項並移項，得 x＝4；代入原式左右相等。","answerFormat":"single-choice","verification":{"equation":"0.5*x-1.5=-0.5*x+2.5","root":"4","domain":"rational"},"f